{"id":"b92387d50aeb7ba0","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-sigma01.md","title":"Σ⁰₁自然数集","display":"df-sigma01 — Σ⁰₁自然数集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-sigma01","aliases":["43-df-sigma01"],"display":"df-sigma01 — Σ⁰₁自然数集","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.5.1, print p.17 / PDF p.37","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-sigma01"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-sigma01</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma01 — Σ⁰₁自然数集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.5.1, print p.17 / PDF p.37"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；CE见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>；本页的Σ⁰₁是自然数集层次，Cantor空间有效开类另见本目录有效开集定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^0_1:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>避免把自然数集的Σ⁰₁与实数类的Σ⁰₁不加编码地混用。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.5.1, print p.17 / PDF p.37。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；CE见 [[43-df-ce]]；本页的Σ⁰₁是自然数集层次，Cantor空间有效开类另见本目录有效开集定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_1:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":883,"backlinks":[{"id":"8aa544265e4689d9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma^0_1$ 采用 [[43-df-sigma01]] 的自然数集定义。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-sigma01]] — Σ⁰₁自然数集"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104"]}